            "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:06:34.385127+00:00",
            "notes": "- If you and your team are struggling to survive or taking a lot of damage, take [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) with [I.V. Drip](item_4993e9c9-738f-4aba-bfbf-c6247ff71af1). When you nade yourself, you'll be 800 HP and so hard to kill.\n- Otherwise, take [Time Out](item_34fc2f6c-ecd9-489e-98ca-d08f3eb2fac1) with [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78). This makes your Nade so deadly when used offensively and enemies hit by your Nade will feel like they can't move.\n\n- You might not be able to afford [I.V. Drip](item_4993e9c9-738f-4aba-bfbf-c6247ff71af1) with [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78), so in that case, just buy something like [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28).",
